    <body ev:onpageload="scwin.onpageload">

    	<xf:group class="sub_contents" id="" style="">
    		<xf:group class="pgtbox" id="" style="">
    			<xf:trigger class="btn_fav" id="" style="" type="button">
    				<xf:label></xf:label>
    			</xf:trigger>
    			<w2:textbox class="pgt_tit" id="" label="[완성화면] DataList 활용" style="" tagname=""></w2:textbox>
    		</xf:group>
    		<xf:group class="ws_example_grp_desc" id="" style="">
    			<xf:group class="titbox" id="" style="">
    				<w2:textbox class="ws_example_txt_desc_info" id="" label="해당화면은 코딩이 완료된 화면" style="" tagname="h3"></w2:textbox>
    			</xf:group>
    			<xf:group class="" id="" style="" tagname="details">
    				<w2:textbox escape="false" id="" label="실습 목표" style="" tagname="summary"></w2:textbox>
    				<w2:textbox class="" escape="false" id=""
    					label="본 화면은 DataList를 활용하는 실습 화면입니다. &lt;br/&gt;DataList의 API 중 필터링을 동적으로 적용하는 기능과 제시된 값과 일치되는 값을 찾아주는 기능에 대해 확인합니다. &lt;br/&gt;"
    					style="">
    				</w2:textbox>
    			</xf:group>
    			<xf:group class="" id="" style="" tagname="details">
    				<w2:textbox escape="false" id="" label="실습 방법" style="" tagname="summary"></w2:textbox>
    				<w2:textbox class="" escape="false" id=""
    					label="1. 아래의 API를 활용하여 DataList의 Filter 를 실습 해 봅니다. &lt;br/&gt; &amp;nbsp; 1) '성별 선택' &amp;nbsp;selectBox에 onviewchange 이벤트 함수를 추가합니다 &lt;br/&gt; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 추가한 함수에 API를 활용하여 동적으로 dataList의 컬럼별 Filter를 적용해 봅니다.&lt;br/&gt; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;ex) DataList ID.setColumnFilter(); &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; &amp;nbsp; 2) '컬럼 Filter 해제' 버튼에 onclick &amp;nbsp;이벤트 함수를 추가합니다 &amp;nbsp;&lt;br/&gt; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;현재 DataList에 적용된 필터링을 모두 해제하는 API &lt;br/&gt; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;ex) DataList ID.clearFilter(); &lt;br/&gt; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br/&gt;2. API를 활용하여 DataList의 특정 컬럼 값과 입력 한 값이 일치되는 Data를 확인합니다. &lt;br/&gt; &amp;nbsp;1) '일치되는 값 찾기' 버튼에 onclick 이벤트 함수를 추가합니다 &amp;nbsp;&lt;br/&gt; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;ex) DataList ID.getUnmatchedIndex(&quot;EMP_NM, &quot;미길동&quot;, true ); &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; &amp;nbsp;2) '포함되는 값 찾기' 버튼에 onclick 이벤트 함수를 추가합니다 &amp;nbsp;&lt;br/&gt; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;ex) DataList ID.getUnmatchedIndex(&quot;EMP_NM, &quot;미길&quot;, false ); &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;3. 데이터 유형을 변경해 보며 반환데이터를 비교 해 보세요 &lt;br/&gt; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;반환 데이터의 유형은 5가지이며, 유형별 함수는 아래와 같습니다. &amp;nbsp; &lt;br/&gt; &amp;nbsp; 1) JSON 형식 : getMatchedJSON()&lt;br/&gt; &amp;nbsp; 2) 1차원 Array 형식 + 컬럼 정보 : getMatchedArray()&lt;br/&gt; &amp;nbsp; 3) 2차원 Array 형식 : getMatchedData()&lt;br/&gt; &amp;nbsp; 4) XML 형식 : getMatchedXML()&lt;br/&gt; &amp;nbsp; 5) Row Index가 담긴 1차원 Array 형식 : getMatchedIndex()&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;4. &lt;a href=&quot;/_iws/dev_kit/document/api/html/WebSquare.uiplugin.dataList.html&quot; target='_blank'&gt;사용자 가이드&lt;/a&gt;"
    					style="">
    				</w2:textbox>
    			</xf:group>
    		</xf:group>
    		<xf:group class="titbox" id="" style="">
    			<w2:span label="성별 선택 : " style="margin-right: 10px;font-weight: bold;" id=""></w2:span>
    			<xf:select1 allOption="" appearance="minimal" chooseOption="true" class="" direction="auto" disabled="false"
    				disabledClass="w2selectbox_disabled" id="selGender" ref="" renderType="" style="width: 148px;" submenuSize="auto"
    				chooseOptionLabel="$blank" ev:onviewchange="scwin.selGender_onviewchange">
    				<xf:choices>
    					<xf:item>
    						<xf:label><![CDATA[남자]]></xf:label>
    						<xf:value><![CDATA[M]]></xf:value>
    					</xf:item>
    					<xf:item>
    						<xf:label><![CDATA[여자]]></xf:label>
    						<xf:value><![CDATA[F]]></xf:value>
    					</xf:item>
    				</xf:choices>
    			</xf:select1>
    			<xf:group class="rt" id="" style="">
    				<xf:trigger class="btn_exam_exec btn_txt_of" id="btnFilter" style="" type="button" ev:onclick="scwin.btnFilter_onclick">
    					<xf:label><![CDATA[컬럼 Filter 해제]]></xf:label>
    				</xf:trigger>
    			</xf:group>
    		</xf:group>
    		<xf:group class="titbox" id="" style="">
    			<w2:span label="성명 검색 : " style="margin-right: 10px;font-weight: bold;" id=""></w2:span>
    			<w2:searchbox id="iptSearch" style="width: 150px;height: 21px;" ev:onkeydown="scwin.iptSearch_onkeydown"></w2:searchbox>
    			<xf:group class="rt" id="" style="">
    				<xf:trigger class="btn_exam_exec btn_txt_of" id="btnMatch" style="" type="button" ev:onclick="scwin.btnMatch_onclick">
    					<xf:label><![CDATA[일치되는 값 찾기]]></xf:label>
    				</xf:trigger>
    				<xf:trigger class="btn_exam_exec btn_txt_of" id="btnCondition" style="" type="button" ev:onclick="scwin.btnCondition_onclick">
    					<xf:label><![CDATA[포함되는 값 찾기]]></xf:label>
    				</xf:trigger>
    			</xf:group>
    		</xf:group>
    		<xf:group adaptiveThreshold="" class="gvwbox" id="" style="">
    			<w2:gridView autoFit="allColumn" checkReadOnlyOnPasteEnable="" class="gvw" dataList="data:dc_userInfoList"
    				defaultCellHeight="26" focusMode="row" id="grd" scrollByColumn="false" scrollByColumnAdaptive="false" style="height: 150px;margin-bottom: 10px;"
    				visibleRowNum="10" readOnly="true" rowNumVisible="true" rowNumHeaderValue="No." autoFitMinWidth="900"
    				backgroundColorMode="always">
    				<w2:caption style="" id="caption1" value="this is a grid caption."></w2:caption>
    				<w2:header style="" id="header1">
    					<w2:row style="" id="row1">
    						<w2:column width="70" inputType="text" style="" id="column12" value="사번" displayMode="label"></w2:column>
    						<w2:column width="100" inputType="text" style="" id="column11" value="성명" displayMode="label"></w2:column>
    						<w2:column width="70" inputType="text" style="" id="column10" value="성별" displayMode="label"></w2:column>
    						<w2:column width="100" inputType="text" style="" id="column9" value="가입일" displayMode="label"></w2:column>
    						<w2:column width="150" inputType="text" style="" id="column4" value="이메일" displayMode="label"></w2:column>
    						<w2:column width="100" inputType="text" style="" id="column3" value="우편번호" displayMode="label"></w2:column>
    						<w2:column width="150" inputType="text" style="" id="column2" value="주소" displayMode="label"></w2:column>
    						<w2:column width="120" inputType="text" style="" id="column1" value="상세주소" displayMode="label"></w2:column>
    					</w2:row>
    				</w2:header>
    				<w2:gBody style="" id="gBody1">
    					<w2:row style="" id="row2">
    						<w2:column width="70" inputType="text" style=";background-color:;" id="EMP_CD" value="" displayMode="label"></w2:column>
    						<w2:column width="100" inputType="text" style=";background-color:;" id="EMP_NM" value="" displayMode="label"></w2:column>
    						<w2:column width="70" inputType="select" style="" id="GENDER_CD" value="" displayMode="label" allOption=""
    							chooseOption="" ref="">
    							<w2:choices>
    								<w2:item>
    									<w2:label><![CDATA[남자]]></w2:label>
    									<w2:value><![CDATA[M]]></w2:value>
    								</w2:item>
    								<w2:item>
    									<w2:label><![CDATA[여자]]></w2:label>
    									<w2:value><![CDATA[F]]></w2:value>
    								</w2:item>
    							</w2:choices>
    						</w2:column>
    						<w2:column width="100" inputType="text" style="" id="JOIN_DATE" value="" displayMode="label"></w2:column>
    						<w2:column width="150" inputType="text" style="" id="EMAIL" value="" displayMode="label"></w2:column>
    						<w2:column width="100" inputType="text" style="" id="ZIP_CD" value="" displayMode="label"></w2:column>
    						<w2:column width="150" inputType="text" style="" id="ADDRESS1" value="" displayMode="label"></w2:column>
    						<w2:column width="120" inputType="text" style="" id="ADDRESS2" value="" displayMode="label"></w2:column>
    					</w2:row>
    				</w2:gBody>
    			</w2:gridView>
    			<xf:group class="example_div_td_style" id="" style="">
    				<w2:textbox class="ws_example_txt_desc_info" id="" label="아래 로그 확인 영역에서 반환 데이터를 유형별로 비교 해 보세요" style="background-color: #eee;padding:10px 10px;"></w2:textbox>
    				<xf:group class="titbox" id="" style="">
    					<w2:span id="" label="데이터 유형 :" style="margin-right: 10px;font-weight: bold;"></w2:span>
    					<xf:select1 id="sel_type" chooseOption="true" style="width: 148px;height: 21px;" submenuSize="auto" allOption=""
    						disabled="false" direction="auto" appearance="minimal" disabledClass="w2selectbox_disabled" ref=""
    						chooseOptionLabel="유형을 선택하세요" textAlign="left" ev:onviewchange="scwin.sel_type_onviewchange">
    						<xf:choices>
    							<xf:item>
    								<xf:label><![CDATA[JSON 형식]]></xf:label>
    								<xf:value><![CDATA[01]]></xf:value>
    							</xf:item>
    							<xf:item>
    								<xf:label><![CDATA[1차원 Array 형식 + 컬럼 정보]]></xf:label>
    								<xf:value><![CDATA[02]]></xf:value>
    							</xf:item>
    							<xf:item>
    								<xf:label><![CDATA[2차원 Array 형식]]></xf:label>
    								<xf:value><![CDATA[03]]></xf:value>
    							</xf:item>
    							<xf:item>
    								<xf:label><![CDATA[XML 형식]]></xf:label>
    								<xf:value><![CDATA[04]]></xf:value>
    							</xf:item>
    							<xf:item>
    								<xf:label><![CDATA[1차원 Array 형식]]></xf:label>
    								<xf:value><![CDATA[05]]></xf:value>
    							</xf:item>
    						</xf:choices>
    					</xf:select1>
    					<xf:group class="rt" id="" style="">
    					</xf:group>
    				</xf:group>
    				<xf:group class="mb_def_box nobottom" id="" style=""></xf:group>
    				<xf:group class="mb_def_box nobottom" id="" style="">
    					<w2:span class="mr_def txt_bold" id="" label="로그 확인" style=""></w2:span>
    					<xf:trigger class="wre_btn_log_clear" ev:onclick="scwin.btn_clearLog_onclick" id="" style="" title="로그 삭제"
    						type="button" userData1="txa_log_1">
    						<xf:label><![CDATA[로그 삭제]]></xf:label>
    					</xf:trigger>
    				</xf:group>
    				<xf:textarea class="wre_txa_log" id="txa_log_1" spellcheck="false" style="width:100%;height:160px;"></xf:textarea>
    			</xf:group>
    		</xf:group>
    	</xf:group>
    </body>
</html>
